      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**1 瓦特**$=\\frac{\\textbf{1 焦耳}}{\\textbf{1 秒}}$，**或 1 瓦特$=$1 焦/秒.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在工程技术中广泛地使用着另一些大得多的功率单",
        "位——千瓦、兆瓦、马力等. 1 千瓦$=1000$ 瓦特；1 兆瓦",
        "$=1000000$ 瓦特；1 马力$=736$ 瓦特."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例题　试求流过堤坝的水流的功率，已知水的落差为25",
        "米，流量是每分钟120 米$^3$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**解：**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1 分钟内落下的水的质量是 $m=\\rho V$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$m=1000$ 千克/米$^3\\times120$ 米$^3=120000$ 千克."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作用在这部分水上的重力为"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$F=9.8$ 牛顿/千克$\\times120000$ 千克$\\approx1200000$ 牛顿."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "故水流在1 分钟内所做的功为 $A=Fh$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$A=1200000$ 牛顿$\\times25$ 米$=30000000$ 焦耳."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "水流的功率 $N=\\frac{A}{t}$；而 $t=1$ 分钟$=60$ 秒，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "故"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$N=\\frac{30000000\\text{焦耳}}{60\\text{秒}}=500000$ 瓦特$=0.5$ 兆瓦."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "各种不同的发动机的功率也很不相同，小的只有百分之",
        "几甚至千分之几千瓦（如电动刮脸刀和缝纫机上用的电动",
        "机），大的可达几十万千瓦（如水轮机和汽轮机）. 每台发动机",
        "上都有一个小牌子（铭牌），上面写着有关该发动机的几项数",
        "据，功率就是其中的一项."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "人在正常工作条件下工作时的功率平均为70—80 瓦特.",
        "当人跳跃时或跑上楼梯时的功率可达730 瓦特左右. 在一些"
      ]
    },
    {
